            "text": "wg"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "If no COMMAND is specified, COMMAND defaults to [[p0]]. Sub-commands that take an INTERFACE must be passed a WireGuard interface.",
