    {
      "id": "s0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "A private key and a corresponding public key may be generated at once by calling: [[p0]] $ umask 077 [[p1]] $ wg genkey | tee private.key | wg pubkey > public.key",
      "protected": [
